~ initialize_local_variables

=> start

~ start
Shopkeeper: [do DialogueFuncs.play_sfx("sfx_shh")]Shh. Be quiet. My daughter's just fallen asleep. 
Shopkeeper: She's been helping me out all day and I'd hate for us to wake her up with our chatter. 
Shopkeeper: Oh my. You look terrible. How long has it been since you last slept?
Shopkeeper: ...Or showered.
Shopkeeper: Anyway, you're finally here, and that's all that matters! I've been expecting you. 
Shopkeeper: I know who you are and why you've come. The Goddess told me everything. 
Shopkeeper: Except for your name. What shall I call you?
- I'm not sure...
	Sarah: [do DialogueFuncs.play_sfx("sfx_door_open")]...Dad? What's going on? Who is that? => dad 
- Keeper, something...
	Sarah: [do DialogueFuncs.play_sfx("sfx_door_open")]...Dad? What's going on? Who is that? => dad 
- I can't remember...
	Sarah: [do DialogueFuncs.play_sfx("sfx_door_open")]...Dad? What's going on? Who is that? => dad 
- Uh... how about Joan?
	Sarah: [do DialogueFuncs.play_sfx("sfx_door_open")][do Variables.set_var("joan_name", true)]...Dad? What's going on? Who is that? => dad 
~ dad
Shopkeeper: Hells. Go back to sleep, dearest. Everything's fine. 
Sarah: [#sprite=upset][do DialogueFuncs.play_sfx("sfx_sniff")]I've had one of those dreams again... They're back. And they're... not happy. 
Shopkeeper: [#sprite=worried]Shush, pumpkin. Back to bed, I said. I'm right behind you.[do! DialogueFuncs.exit_characters(["Sarah"])] 
Shopkeeper: [#sprite=worried][wait=0.6]...I'm sorry. Have to go. That there's your room. I've readied a change of clothes and a warm bath for you. 
Shopkeeper: Make sure to get some sleep. Tomorrow we wake early. 
Shopkeeper: See you then. 
- Sorry I woke her up.
	Shopkeeper: [#sprite=worried]No harm done. It wasn't you. 
	Shopkeeper: [#sprite=worried]Good night.[do DialogueFuncs.play_sfx("sfx_door_close")][do! DialogueFuncs.exit_characters(["Shopkeeper"])] => fragment
- Weird welcoming party. 
	Shopkeeper: [#sprite=worried]Hah. I know. You'll have to forgive me. Hospitality is usually my strong suit.
	Shopkeeper: I'll make it up to you, I promise. Good night.[do DialogueFuncs.play_sfx("sfx_door_close")][do! DialogueFuncs.exit_characters(["Shopkeeper"])] => fragment
- But I have so many questions. 
	Shopkeeper: And I'll answer each and every one of them as best I can. 
	Shopkeeper: But it will have to wait until tomorrow. Forgive me. 
	Shopkeeper: Good night.[do DialogueFuncs.play_sfx("sfx_door_close")][do! DialogueFuncs.exit_characters(["Shopkeeper"])] => fragment
- What did she mean? Who's not happy?
	Shopkeeper: No one. It's just these nightmares she's been having.
	Shopkeeper: Nothing to worry about. Good night.[do DialogueFuncs.play_sfx("sfx_door_close")][do! DialogueFuncs.exit_characters(["Shopkeeper"])]  => fragment

~ fragment
A frail fragment: [wait=1.5]That was... interesting. 
- That's one way to put it. => frail
- What the hell are you, anyway?
	A frail fragment: I am a frail fragment of a feeble mind. Which is to say, close to nothing, really. 
	A frail fragment: I'm all that's left of you. The real you, I mean. The Goddess couldn't, or perhaps didn't want to, strip your mind completely bare, apparently.
	A frail fragment: Anyway, I won't be of much use to you. If any. 
	- Uh, okay. Great.
		A frail fragment: Yeah. I'm not any happier about it than you are. => frail
	- I'm scared. 
		A frail fragment: Oh, well, guess I'm scared too, then. => frail 
	
~ frail
A frail fragment: Anyway, time to take a bath. 
- Good idea.
	A frail fragment: Let's go then.
	A frail fragment: ...[do Variables.set_var("showered", true)][do DialogueFuncs.play_sfx("sfx_door_close")] => END 
- Think I'll just go to sleep. 
	A frail fragment: Uh, you sure you don't wanna take a bath first?
	- Fine. Bath it is. 
		A frail fragment: Phew. Let's go then.
		A frail fragment: ...[do Variables.set_var("showered", true)][do DialogueFuncs.play_sfx("sfx_door_close")] => END
	- Nah. 
		A frail fragment: Your choice. Let's go then.[do DialogueFuncs.unlock_achievement("What's that smell? - Showers are for the weak.")]
		A frail fragment: ...[do DialogueFuncs.play_sfx("sfx_door_close")] => END 

=> END

